+    <section class="philosophy" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="philosophy-title"><div class="wrap philosophy-grid"><div class="philosophy-lead"><span class="eyebrow" lang="en">02 / OUR APPROACH</span><h2 id="philosophy-title">少一点修饰，<br>多一点本来的味道。</h2><p class="measure-prose">我们相信，好的烘焙不是盖过一颗豆子的声音，<br class="desktop-break">而是让它被听见。从生豆到杯中，每一步都认真。</p><div class="mountain-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 330 90"><path d="m2 80 65-58 40 31 54-45 76 66 41-39 49 45M43 81l26-35 37 35m33 0 24-44 48 44" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="267" cy="13" r="10" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span lang="en">ROOTED IN ORIGIN. ROASTED WITH INTENTION.</span></div></div><div class="principles"><article><span lang="en">01</span><div><h3>风味，始于产地</h3><p>关注品种、海拔与处理方式，选择个性清晰的生豆，让每一份风味都有迹可循。</p></div></article><article><span lang="en">02</span><div><h3>小批量，慢慢打磨</h3><p>根据每支豆子的特点调整烘焙曲线。反复杯测，找到香气、甜感与口感之间的平衡。</p></div></article><article><span lang="en">03</span><div><h3>好喝，才是目的</h3><p>不让术语挡在你和咖啡之间。无论手冲还是加奶，你喜欢的那一杯，就是好咖啡。</p></div></article></div></div></section>
+    <section class="visit wrap" id="visit" aria-labelledby="visit-title"><div class="visit-copy"><span class="eyebrow" lang="en">03 / FIND US</span><h2 id="visit-title">顺路，来喝一杯。</h2><p class="measure-prose">闻一闻刚烘好的豆子，聊聊你喜欢的风味。<br>不用懂很多咖啡，也欢迎来坐坐。</p><div class="visit-details"><div><span class="detail-label">工作室地址</span><address>详细地址待填写</address><span class="detail-note">城市、街道与门牌号将在这里更新</span></div><div><span class="detail-label">营业时间</span><span>待工作室确认</span><span class="detail-note">到店前请查看最新营业安排</span></div></div><span class="visit-foot">一杯咖啡的时间，我们山间见。 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div><div class="visit-poster" aria-label="山间工作室欢迎海报"><div class="poster-top" lang="en"><span>THE NEIGHBORHOOD<br>COFFEE ROASTERY</span><span>山间</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 440 240" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M75 203h297M118 203V88h206v115M104 88l117-63 117 63" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M138 104h165v35H138zM141 155h58v48m40 0v-48h60v48M169 155v48M239 174h60M266 155v48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m138 104 15 35 15-35 15 35 15-35 15 35 15-35 15 35 15-35 15 35 15-35" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M83 203v-40m-13-7q13-26 26 0c0 22-26 22-26 0M350 203v-40m-13-7q13-26 26 0c0 22-26 22-26 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="280" cy="37" r="14" fill="currentColor"/></svg><div class="poster-slogan">把时间，留给一杯咖啡。</div><span class="poster-bottom" lang="en">THERE’S ALWAYS TIME FOR A GOOD CUP.</span></div></section>
+  </main>
+  <footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><a class="footer-brand" href="#">山间 <span lang="en">SHAN JIAN</span></a><span>来自山野，融入日常。</span><a href="#main">回到顶部 ↑</a></div><div class="wrap footer-note"><span lang="en">© 2026 SHAN JIAN COFFEE ROASTERS</span><span>独立咖啡烘焙工作室 · 示例品牌页面</span></div></footer>
+  <dialog id="bean-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭详情">×</button><span class="eyebrow" lang="en">GET TO KNOW YOUR COFFEE</span><h2 id="dialog-title"></h2><p id="dialog-description"></p><div class="brew-tip"><strong>冲煮起点</strong><p id="dialog-tip"></p></div><p class="dialog-note">风味描述和冲煮参数供参考，可根据设备与口味调整。此处为示例产品信息。</p><form method="dialog"><button class="button">继续逛豆单 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form></dialog>
+  <script>
+    const coffees = {
+      flower: { title: '花间 · 耶加雪菲', description: '水洗处理带来清晰、轻盈的口感。茉莉花般的香气之后，是柠檬的明亮与蜂蜜般的柔和甜感，适合喜欢清爽手冲的你。', tip: '手冲可从 15 克咖啡粉、240 克水、92℃ 水温开始，使用中细研磨。' },
+      fruit: { title: '山果 · 慧兰', description: '红苹果的果香与焦糖甜感相遇，尾韵带着温和的坚果香。口感圆润，适合做一杯午后的手冲，也适合用法压壶慢慢分享。', tip: '手冲可从 15 克咖啡粉、225 克水、90℃ 水温开始，使用中等研磨。' },
+      daily: { title: '日常 · 招牌拼配', description: '以黑巧克力和榛果为主调，带着绵密的奶油口感。做浓缩醇厚扎实，加入牛奶后，甜感也依然清晰。', tip: '意式浓缩可从 18 克咖啡粉、36 克咖啡液开始，萃取时间参考 25 至 30 秒，再按口味调整研磨。' }
+    };
+    const dialog = document.getElementById('bean-dialog');
+    document.querySelectorAll('[data-bean]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
+      const coffee = coffees[button.dataset.bean];
+      document.getElementById('dialog-title').textContent = coffee.title;
+      document.getElementById('dialog-description').textContent = coffee.description;
+      document.getElementById('dialog-tip').textContent = coffee.tip;
+      dialog.showModal();
+    }));
+    document.querySelector('.dialog-close').addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
+    dialog.addEventListener('click', event => {
+      const rect = dialog.getBoundingClientRect();
+      if (event.target === dialog && (event.clientX < rect.left || event.clientX > rect.right || event.clientY < rect.top || event.clientY > rect.bottom)) dialog.close();
+    });
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
